  "caption": "Episodic memory is less like playback and more like reconstruction.\n\nA major review in *Neuroscience & Biobehavioral Reviews* synthesizing nearly 200 papers argues that recall assembles an event from distributed fragments, knowledge, and present context.\n\nThe unsettling detail is that the reconstructed version can be saved back in, so what you remember later may be the edited cut, not the original.\n\nMore inside.\n\n#TheBoldUnknown #TheUnknownExplained #Curiosity #HumanBehavior #Neuroscience #CognitiveScience #MemoryResearch #Memory #EpisodicMemory #CognitiveBias",
